body:
The `CustomerServiceAgent` example does not match `AgentSchema`: `label` is required, `model` must be an object `{ provider, model, temperature, ... }` (not a string), `temperature` is not a top-level field, and `tools` must be an array of `{ type, name, description? }` (not string literals). As written, `AgentSchema.parse(...)` would throw. Please revise the sample to conform to `packages/spec/src/ai/agent.zod.ts`.
```suggestion
  label: '智能客服 Agent',
  role: 'customer_support',
  instructions: '你是专业的客服代表，帮助客户解决问题，优先使用知识库进行回答，必要时创建工单或转接人工客服。',
  tools: [
    {
      type: 'rag_pipeline',
      name: 'knowledge_base_search',
      description: 'RAG检索：从知识库中查找和检索相关答案',
    },
    {
      type: 'workflow',
      name: 'ticket_creation',
      description: '为复杂问题创建和分配客服工单',
    },
    {
      type: 'api_call',
      name: 'order_lookup',
      description: '查询并返回用户订单的状态和详情',
    },
    {
      type: 'handoff',
      name: 'escalate_to_human',
      description: '在需要时将对话无缝转接到人工客服',
    },
  ],
  model: {
    provider: 'openai',
    model: 'gpt-4o-mini',
    temperature: 0.7,
  },
```
